  "items": [
    {
      "name": "Why this happens",
      "char_file": "커피_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "The bladder wall reacts to",
        "what's concentrated in urine",
        "",
        "Some everyday foods make",
        "that reaction - and the",
        "burning - noticeably worse"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Caffeine",
      "char_file": "커피_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Coffee and tea stimulate",
        "the bladder directly and",
        "increase urine output"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Caffeine — the fix",
      "char_file": "커피_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Swap for water or",
        "herbal tea"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Diet Soda",
      "char_file": "탄산음료_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Artificial sweeteners can",
        "aggravate an already",
        "inflamed bladder lining"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Diet Soda — the fix",
      "char_file": "탄산음료_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Try plain still",
        "water instead"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Citrus Fruit",
      "char_file": "귤_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Orange juice and other",
        "citrus are high in",
        "citric acid",
        "",
        "That acidity can directly",
        "irritate the bladder lining"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Citrus — the fix",
      "char_file": "귤_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Try a lower-acid fruit",
        "like banana instead"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "closing": {
    "headline": [
      [
        "None of these need",
        "to disappear for good"
      ],
      [
        "Small swaps make",
        "a real difference"
      ]
    ],
    "tip": [
      "Drinking plenty of plain water helps",
